"<main role=\"main\" aria-label=\"Shanghai Proton and Heavy Ion Center\" class=\"min-h-screen bg-white\"><section class=\"relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-slate-950\"><img src=\"https://q8.itc.cn/q_70/images03/20240902/391ace030ff24b75aef210d6a09b2bc0.jpeg\" alt=\"Shanghai Proton Heavy Ion Hospital exterior\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-950/85 via-indigo-950/70 to-blue-950/80\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center text-white py-32\"><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-6\">Shanghai Proton Heavy Ion Hospital</h1><p class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-300 mb-4\">Fudan University Affiliated Proton Heavy Ion Hospital</p><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8\">Precision Particle Radiotherapy · Protecting Life and Health</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mb-8\"><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\">China's first hospital offering both proton and heavy ion therapy</span><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\">9,317 total patients treated</span><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\">50+ treatable diseases</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4\"><button class=\"px-8 py-3 bg-white text-blue-900 rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors\">Learn More</button><a class=\"px-8 py-3 border-2 border-white text-white rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\" href=\"/contact\">Book Consultation</a></div></div></div></section><section id=\"intro\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Hospital Overview</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">Shanghai Proton Heavy Ion Hospital (Fudan University Affiliated) is located in Zhangjiang Science City, Pudong New Area. It is China's first specialized oncology institution offering both proton and heavy ion advanced radiotherapy technologies.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-6 mb-12\"><div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-2\">10 hectares</div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Area</p></div><div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-2\">220 beds</div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Beds</p></div><div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-2\">50+ types</div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Treatable Diseases</p></div><div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-2\">9,317 cases</div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Total Patients</p></div><div class=\"bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-2\">1,000+/year</div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Annual Cases</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 rounded-2xl p-8\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed\">The hospital covers 10 hectares with 220 approved beds. Since official operation began in May 2015, leveraging precise proton and heavy ion radiotherapy technology, treatable diseases have expanded to over 50 types, covering the vast majority of common malignant tumors in China.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Technical Features &amp; Advantageous Treatments</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">The hospital specializes in heavy ion radiotherapy, with 75% of clinical patients receiving pure heavy ion or combined heavy ion-proton therapy</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-4\">Nasopharyngeal Cancer</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-3\">World's largest particle center for nasopharyngeal cancer heavy ion therapy</p><p class=\"text-blue-600 font-medium text-sm\">5-year OS rate 93.8% for newly diagnosed patients</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-4\">Lung Cancer</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-3\">85% of lung cancer patients receive heavy ion therapy</p><p class=\"text-blue-600 font-medium text-sm\">Stage I NSCLC 5-year OS rate 73.8%</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-4\">Pancreatic Cancer</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-3\">Pioneer in pure heavy ion therapy for locally recurrent cases</p><p class=\"text-blue-600 font-medium text-sm\">3-year OS 33.1%, median survival 26.8 months</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-4\">Prostate Cancer</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-3\">Pure heavy ion therapy for localized prostate cancer</p><p class=\"text-blue-600 font-medium text-sm\">5-year OS 97.2%, prostate-specific survival 100%</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-4\">Breast Cancer</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-3\">Primarily proton therapy</p><p class=\"text-blue-600 font-medium text-sm\">5-year OS rate 97.3%</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-4\">Liver Cancer</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-3\">Precise tumor cell destruction with maximum liver protection</p><p class=\"text-blue-600 font-medium text-sm\">Significant clinical advantages in unresectable liver cancer and metastases</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">Expert Team · Quality Care</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">Deeply integrated with Fudan University Shanghai Cancer Center with shared resources, gathering top domestic talent in oncology radiotherapy</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-16\"><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-24 h-24 bg-blue-600 rounded-full mx-auto mb-4 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucid