path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>Cai Xin, Associate Chief Physician</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-600\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>Mei Xin, Associate Chief Physician</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-blue-600\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>Li Ping, Associate Chief Physician</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-12\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-6\">Other Core Experts</h3><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-50 to-purple-50 rounded-2xl p-6\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-indigo-600 mb-2\">Song Shaoli</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mb-2\">Chief Physician, PhD Supervisor</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">Director of Nuclear Medicine\nDirector of Shanghai Molecular Imaging Probe Engineering Center\nShanghai Leading Talent\nProvides core technical support for precision diagnosis and imaging evaluation</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-600 to-indigo-700 text-white\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center\"><div style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6\">Excellence in Particle Radiotherapy · Focused on Oncology Care</h2><p class=\"text-xl text-blue-100 mb-8\">Location: Zhangjiang Science City, Pudong New Area, Shanghai</p><a class=\"inline-block px-8 py-4 bg-white text-blue-600 rounded-full font-bold text-lg hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors\" href=\"/contact\">Book Consultation Now</a></div></div></section></main>"